    <title>Experimental Evidence on Structural State Dependence in Demand</title>
    <updated>2026-10-30T00:00:00+00:00</updated>
    <author>
      <name>Sebastian Gabel, Daniel Guhl, Günter J. Hitsch, Kyoung Hwan (Joe) Kook</name>
    </author>
    <content>&lt;b&gt;Marketing Science&lt;/b&gt; &lt;br&gt;The paper provides nonparametric estimates of structural state dependence from a natural field experiment for 223 brands.</content>
