      <name>Rubén Gonzálvez, Xiaolin Li, Sarit Weisburd, Xinrong Zhu</name>
    </author>
    <content>&lt;b&gt;Marketing Science&lt;/b&gt; &lt;br&gt;Using data from the mineral water category on a price comparison platform that delivers real-time prompts of cheaper alternatives through “swap and save” buttons, this study examines whether and how these prompts influence persistent product choices in online grocery shopping.</content>
